---
Delete a conversation and its transcript

Usage: mxr assistant delete [OPTIONS] <CONVERSATION>

Arguments:
  <CONVERSATION>

Options:
      --dry-run          Show what would be deleted, without deleting it
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
